The seed embeds lib/*.coil via include-str at ITS build time, so a seed older than a
stdlib change cannot compile source that uses the new stdlib. Re-bless the seed in the
same commit as any lib/ change the compiler itself depends on, or the next clean
bootstrap breaks. (Bridge for a stale seed: COIL_STDLIB_DIR=$PWD, which makes the
loader prefer live source over the embedded copies.)

